
h1 Organizations, workspaces, and access API

h2 Session access and roles
Action | Required role
Create workspaces, rename an organization, manage billing | Organization owner or admin
Promote/demote organization owners or admins | Organization owner; the last owner must remain
Remove ordinary organization members | Organization owner or admin
Invite an organization admin | Organization owner
Invite an ordinary member | Organization owner or admin
List or read invitations; revoke or resend a member invitation | Organization owner or admin
Revoke or resend an admin invitation | Organization owner
View organization usage | Organization owner or admin
Rename a workspace, manage its members or API keys | Workspace admin, including inherited organization owner/admin access
Leave an organization | The current member, unless they are its last owner

h2 POST /v1/account/bootstrap
Name | Location | Value | Required
Idempotency-Key | header | string | Yes
Field | Type | Present | Constraints
provisioned | true | Yes | 
organization_id | string or null | Yes | uuid
workspace_id | string or null | Yes | uuid

h2 GET /v1/me
Field | Type | Present | Constraints
user_id | string | Yes | uuid
email | string | Yes | email
status | active, disabled, unprovisioned | Yes | 
provisioned | boolean | Yes | 
compatibility | object | Yes | 
compatibility.cli | object | Yes | Compatibility details for the WonderSearch CLI.
compatibility.cli.api_major | integer | Yes | Major version of this API.
compatibility.cli.minimum_cli_version | string | Yes | Oldest CLI version that works with this API.
compatibility.cli.latest_stable_cli_version | string or null | Yes | Newest stable CLI release, or null when none is published.
compatibility.cli.notices | array of object | Yes | Upgrade and deprecation notices; can be empty.
compatibility.cli.notices[].id | string | Yes | 
compatibility.cli.notices[].severity | upgrade, deprecation | Yes | 
compatibility.cli.notices[].message | string | Yes | 
compatibility.cli.notices[].effective_date | string | Optional | date-time
compatibility.cli.notices[].documentation_url | string | Optional | uri

h2 GET /v1/organizations
Name | Location | Value | Required
limit | query | integer | Optional
cursor | query | string | Optional
Field | Type | Present | Constraints
data | array of object | Yes | 
data[].id | string | Optional | uuid
data[].version | string | Optional | 
data[].created_at | string | Optional | date-time
data[].updated_at | string | Optional | date-time
data[].name | string | Optional | 
data[].status | active | Optional | Suspended organizations are not returned.
data[].tier | free, paid, credit_only | Optional | Organization billing type. Set by WonderSearch; it cannot be changed through the API.
data[].search_limits | free, paid, unlimited | Optional | Organization search rate tier. Set by WonderSearch.
data[].free_storage_policy_id | string | Optional | Identifier of the free storage allowance that applies to this organization. Set by WonderSearch.
data[].created_by | string | Optional | uuid
data[].bootstrap_user_id | string or null | Optional | uuid
data[].role | owner, admin, member | Optional | 
data[].etag | string | Optional | 
next_cursor | string or null | Yes | 

