h2 POST /v1/invitations/preview
Field | Type | Presence | Guidance
token | string | Required | Token from the recipient’s invitation link.
Field | Type | Present | Constraints
organization_id | string | Yes | uuid
organization_name | string | Optional | Returned for a pending invitation.
organization_role | admin, member | Optional | Returned for a pending invitation.
workspaces | array of object | Optional | Workspace assignments applied on acceptance; can be empty.
workspaces[].workspace_id | string | Yes | uuid
workspaces[].role | admin, editor, viewer | Yes | 
accepted | true | Optional | Returned instead of the preview fields when the signed-in user has already accepted this invitation.

